- Min Seo!

314
00:26:29.800 --> 00:26:31.340
Look who got off work on time?

315
00:26:31.400 --> 00:26:33.590
Of course. You guys were desperately calling me.

316
00:26:33.590 --> 00:26:35.000
Hello.

317
00:26:39.050 --> 00:26:41.190
- He's there!
- Hurry!

318
00:26:41.190 --> 00:26:42.670
- Let's go.
- Yeah.

319
00:26:42.690 --> 00:26:44.110
[Byeol's Diner]

320
00:26:45.270 --> 00:26:47.900
