- Hey. guys.

321
00:26:47.900 --> 00:26:48.960
Long time no see.

322
00:26:48.960 --> 00:26:50.730
Hurry. go in.

323
00:26:51.400 --> 00:26:53.810
Long time no see. oppa.

324
00:26:53.810 --> 00:26:55.110
Yeah.

325
00:26:55.110 --> 00:26:56.400
I'm a bad son.

326
00:26:56.400 --> 00:26:58.870
Aigoo. So you know.

327
00:26:58.870 --> 00:27:00.390
Jjolmyeon for all four of you?

328
00:27:00.390 --> 00:27:02.600
<i>Yes!</i>

329
00:27:06.130 --> 00:27:08.840
Aigoo. aigoo. I'm full. Aigoo...

330
00:27:09.940 --> 00:27:13.430
It took me super long. even after getting into apprenticeship. to do OJT.

331
00:27:13.430 --> 00:27:14.410
I know.

332
00:27:14.410 --> 00:27:16.760
They said we could go right on-site. so I shot my hand up.

333
00:27:16.760 --> 00:27:18.160
Wow.

334
00:27:18.160 --> 00:27:22.490
