387
00:32:16.870 --> 00:32:18.790
I hurt myself while working.

388
00:32:19.550 --> 00:32:23.070
Drop by the nurse's office first and go to the Architectural Design office.

389
00:32:23.070 --> 00:32:24.290
Okay.

390
00:32:28.500 --> 00:32:31.130
