400
00:33:04.800 --> 00:33:06.080
[Goddess of Nulji. Go Eun Bi's choreography video passes 100k views]

401
00:33:09.310 --> 00:33:11.770
Jong Bok. Is it time yet?

402
00:33:11.770 --> 00:33:13.570
No. not yet.

403
00:33:13.570 --> 00:33:16.140
A firecracker is all about timing.

404
00:33:16.140 --> 00:33:17.470
You know that. right?

405
00:33:17.470 --> 00:33:19.310
Why am I doing this?

406
00:33:19.310 --> 00:33:20.810
You're my friend.

407
00:33:22.020 --> 00:33:23.270
Sure.

408
00:33:27.180 --> 00:33:28.510
She's coming!

409
00:33:37.320 --> 00:33:40.930
[Goddess of Nulji. Go Eun Bi's choreography video passes 100k views]

410
00:33:49.920 --> 00:33:52.430
Who... are you?

411
00:34:01.560 --> 00:34:03.680
What's this? What's going on?

412
00:34:04.520 --> 00:34:05.880
Eun Bi.

413
00:34:08.210 --> 00:34:10.570
What are you doing? Sit down.

414
00:34:12.840 --> 00:34:15.150
The new student should come forward to say hello.

415
00:34:23.510 --> 00:34:25.870
I told you there was a new transfer student coming today. right?

416
00:34:25.870 --> 00:34:27.580
Help him out. okay?

417
00:34:27.580 --> 00:34:29.900
