What's going on?

423
00:34:51.830 --> 00:34:52.750
Young Joo.

424
00:34:52.750 --> 00:34:54.680
Don't talk to me. you bastard.

425
00:34:56.230 --> 00:34:58.280
I don't want to die.

426
00:35:22.900 --> 00:35:25.500
I tell you. it's him. I saw it with my own eyes.

427
00:35:25.570 --> 00:35:27.310
No way.

428
00:35:28.270 --> 00:35:32.530
When I worked at a factory over the summer. my supervisor was a part of that gang.

429
00:35:32.530 --> 00:35:33.840
That...

430
00:35:35.240 --> 00:35:37.740
The one without a finger...

431
00:35:40.070 --> 00:35:42.390
