435
00:36:16.730 --> 00:36:19.990
<i>So all of that is drug dealing?</i>

436
00:36:33.840 --> 00:36:36.770
<i>He doesn't stab people and stuff. does he?</i>

437
00:36:42.770 --> 00:36:44.570
<i>Then...</i>

438
00:36:44.570 --> 00:36:47.680
<i>- was that thing inside the sack...
- I love you.</i>

439
00:36:47.680 --> 00:36:49.610
a corpse?

440
00:36:54.170 --> 00:36:55.480
Hey. Jin Ji Won!

441
00:36:55.480 --> 00:36:58.230
