445
00:37:35.200 --> 00:37:36.450
What do I do?

446
00:37:36.450 --> 00:37:38.630
You have to watch out for yourself now.

447
00:37:40.080 --> 00:37:41.760
- What do I do?
- Don't say it out loud!

448
00:37:41.760 --> 00:37:43.200
Just stay put.

449
00:37:47.310 --> 00:37:48.960
S***.

450
00:37:51.390 --> 00:37:53.080
S***.

451
00:38:05.510 --> 00:38:06.690
Look who it is.

452
00:38:08.830 --> 00:38:10.210
