456
00:38:16.310 --> 00:38:19.350
Oh. well. I...

457
00:38:20.510 --> 00:38:22.100
Mr. Lee Kang Hoon?

458
00:38:22.100 --> 00:38:23.660
Oh. yes.

459
00:38:24.280 --> 00:38:25.710
