- Yes.

460
00:38:37.410 --> 00:38:39.090
Mr. Lee?

461
00:38:41.030 --> 00:38:46.040
He'll be replacing Mr. Kim Moo Kyung as the woodworking teacher for the Architectural Design department.

462
00:38:48.870 --> 00:38:53.560
