463
00:38:53.560 --> 00:38:55.110
so I trust you are a good fit.

464
00:38:55.110 --> 00:38:58.150
Please take good care of our students.

465
00:38:58.150 --> 00:38:59.960
Yes. of course.

466
00:39:01.050 --> 00:39:02.670
He graduated from Jin Sung University

467
00:39:02.670 --> 00:39:05.610
