468
00:39:05.610 --> 00:39:08.200
so he will be a big help to the kids.

469
00:39:08.200 --> 00:39:11.870
Wow. you received a big award in college for woodworking.

470
00:39:11.870 --> 00:39:13.480
You have a lot of on-site experience.

471
00:39:13.480 --> 00:39:16.030
You don't lack anything.

472
00:39:16.850 --> 00:39:20.130
Please help our kids receive a lot of awards.

473
00:39:21.040 --> 00:39:23.590
Of course. I'll do my best.

474
00:39:27.750 --> 00:39:29.370
Class dismissed.

475
00:39:29.370 --> 00:39:31.250
<i>Thank you.</i>

476
00:39:31.300 --> 00:39:34.600
Oh. the new transfer kid. the teaching director was looking for you.

477
00:39:34.640 --> 00:39:36.080
Head down to the office.

478
00:39:36.080 --> 00:39:37.170
Okay.

