00:41:54.830 --> 00:41:56.220
Eun Bi!

492
00:41:56.220 --> 00:41:58.460
You'll hurt your throat. Let's go.

493
00:41:58.460 --> 00:41:59.820
Let's go.

494
00:42:04.000 --> 00:42:05.310
Eun Bi.

495
00:42:05.310 --> 00:42:07.300
Eun Bi. Here's the juice that you like.

496
00:42:07.300 --> 00:42:08.770
Which one do you want?

497
00:42:08.770 --> 00:42:10.840
- This one.
