498
00:42:10.840 --> 00:42:12.380
Deep breath in.

499
00:42:12.380 --> 00:42:14.430
Slowly. Good.

500
00:42:22.970 --> 00:42:23.830
<i>Young Joo.</i>

501
00:42:23.830 --> 00:42:26.230
<i>Don't talk to me. you bastard.</i>

502
00:42:27.420 --> 00:42:29.470
<i>I don't want to die.</i>

503
00:42:35.330 --> 00:42:37.350
I have a new dream.

504
00:42:37.350 --> 00:42:38.910
I'll be a professional gamer.

505
00:42:40.440 --> 00:42:42.310
