528
00:44:24.530 --> 00:44:25.620
Yeah.

529
00:44:25.620 --> 00:44:27.100
He's handsome.

530
00:44:27.100 --> 00:44:28.430
Whoa.

531
00:44:28.430 --> 00:44:29.720
Why would you look at his looks?

532
00:44:29.720 --> 00:44:32.730
You should judge him by his personality or sense of responsibility.

533
00:44:32.730 --> 00:44:35.830
Oh. so you agree he has good looks?

534
00:44:39.720 --> 00:44:42.190
Anyway. it's a good thing you two are friends.

535
00:44:42.190 --> 00:44:45.060
Teach him properly before you quit next week.

536
00:44:45.060 --> 00:44:46.440
What?

537
00:44:46.440 --> 00:44:48.240
- Me?
- Yeah.

538
00:45:08.090 --> 00:45:10.250
What's your deal these days?

539
00:45:10.810 --> 00:45:12.140
Tell me.

540
00:45:12.140 --> 00:45:14.200
I seriously don't know.

541
00:45:14.200 --> 00:45:15.700
What?

542
00:45:15.700 --> 00:45:19.500
You quit taekwondo. and now you suddenly want to do an apprenticeship.

543
00:45:19.500 --> 00:45:21.340
Is something going on at home?

544
00:45:22.320 --> 00:45:24.040
Just teach me how to work.

545
00:45:24.040 --> 00:45:26.430
What's your deal with the new kid? Why can't you say a thing in front of him?

546
00:45:26.430 --> 00:45:29.470
Hey. Never mind what the deal is with me.

547
00:45:29.470 --> 00:45:31.790
It's unsuitable for us to...

548
00:45:31.790 --> 00:45:34.800
- talk about these things.
- You keep-

549
00:45:35.820 --> 00:45:36.980
What?

550
00:45:40.550 --> 00:45:43.220
You keep hanging around me.

551
00:45:43.220 --> 00:45:45.730
Sorry you keep getting involved with me.

552
00:45:46.590 --> 00:45:48.730
But I have no time to avoid you these days.

553
00:45:50.250 --> 00:45:51.730
I hope you understand.

554
00:46:00.490 --> 00:46:02.270
Come here.

555
00:46:03.310 --> 00:46:05.070
Come here.

556
00:46:09.310 --> 00:46:10.970
Now.

557
00:46:10.970 --> 00:46:13.120
This is the regular bun.

558
00:46:13.120 --> 00:46:15.480
You use this for cheese and shrimp burgers.

559
00:46:15.480 --> 00:46:16.700
What's this again?

560
00:46:16.700 --> 00:46:19.620
- Re-regular bun.
- Used for what?

561
00:46:20.420 --> 00:46:22.210
- Cheese and shrimp burger.
- Cheese and shrimp burger...

562
00:46:22.210 --> 00:46:24.210
Those. right. Sorry.

563
00:46:24.210 --> 00:46:27.270
It's so frustrating. It's going to take forever.

564
00:46:27.270 --> 00:46:28.610
S***.

565
00:46:29.730 --> 00:46:32.340
Thank you. bye.

566
00:46:33.230 --> 00:46:36.020
Director. can we really order everything we want?

567
00:46:36.020 --> 00:46:39.300
She said she would buy us food if we got all As this semester.

568
00:46:39.300 --> 00:46:40.730
- Right?
- Choose what you want.

569
00:46:41.490 --> 00:46:45.430
Can we get three bacon burgers and three double cheeseburgers?

570
00:46:47.750 --> 00:46:51.950
You should buy healthy food. why would you choose...

571
00:46:51.950 --> 00:46:54.310
Ji Won. why isn't this working?

572
00:46:54.310 --> 00:46:56.470
This keeps happening after the update.

573
00:46:59.840 --> 00:47:01.420
I'll do it.

574
00:47:09.560 --> 00:47:12.250
Fifty-two thousand won. For here?

575
00:47:12.250 --> 00:47:14.370
- <i>Yes.</i>
- Wait...

576
00:47:30.450 --> 00:47:32.640
What's up with her? That Nulji High part-timer.

577
00:47:32.640 --> 00:47:33.950
I know.

578
00:47:47.200 --> 00:47:49.860
Ji Soo. I think we can eat the grape tomatoes right away.

579
00:47:49.860 --> 00:47:54.220
- Really?
- I hope they grow well.

580
00:47:54.220 --> 00:47:58.120
The wind is blowing. the wind is blowing.

581
00:47:58.120 --> 00:47:59.660
Blowing. blowing.

582
00:48:03.070 --> 00:48:04.480
Mom's here!

583
00:48:06.560 --> 00:48:08.790
Jin Ji Won. come downstairs.

584
00:48:08.790 --> 00:48:09.980
We need to talk.

585
00:48:10.990 --> 00:48:12.340
Who are you?

586
00:48:13.300 --> 00:48:15.650
Stop acting like a kid.

587
00:48:15.650 --> 00:48:17.280
I couldn't help it earlier.

588
00:48:17.280 --> 00:48:18.480
What?

589
00:48:18.480 --> 00:48:21.440
I thought you wanted me to act like a stranger.

590
00:48:23.080 --> 00:48:25.610
Dad. say something.

591
00:48:25.610 --> 00:48:28.670
You only make me step in these situations.

592
00:48:30.700 --> 00:48:32.090
You're late.

593
00:48:32.090 --> 00:48:33.330
We were waiting.

594
00:48:33.330 --> 00:48:36.020
How about chicken with beer?

595
00:48:37.410 --> 00:48:39.650
I think the academy director is full.

596
00:48:42.450 --> 00:48:45.130
- Just stop it!
- What? Stop what?

597
00:48:45.130 --> 00:48:47.730
You. The school called again.

598
00:48:47.730 --> 00:48:49.340
You protested with a picket again.

599
00:48:49.400 --> 00:48:51.700
Why would you do that? What's your problem?

600
00:48:51.730 --> 00:48:54.950
You hate that I go to Nulji. not that I protested.

601
00:48:54.950 --> 00:48:57.740
So. did I force you to go to that school?

602
00:48:57.740 --> 00:49:02.210
Why are you so fussy since you were little?

603
00:49:02.210 --> 00:49:05.120
Can't you just be ordinary?

604
00:49:05.120 --> 00:49:06.810
Ordinary how?

605
00:49:08.090 --> 00:49:09.120
I see.

606
00:49:09.120 --> 00:49:10.880
Study ordinarily like everyone else.

607
00:49:10.880 --> 00:49:13.300
just be dumb enough to be average. not even knowing what I love to do.

608
00:49:13.300 --> 00:49:15.960
Go to college because everyone else does and barely graduate

609
00:49:15.960 --> 00:49:19.630
only to be jobless and burden you and Dad? That kind of ordinary?

610
00:49:23.830 --> 00:49:25.950
I won't live like that.

611
00:49:26.810 --> 00:49:28.750
This is so annoying.

612
00:49:29.900 --> 00:49:31.960
That little...

613
00:49:31.960 --> 00:49:33.420
Talking back to me...

614
00:49:33.420 --> 00:49:35.170
Hey. Jin Ji Won!

615
00:49:37.480 --> 00:49:39.660
Was she just talking about me?

616
00:49:39.660 --> 00:49:41.210
Good for you.

617
00:49:41.210 --> 00:49:43.080
At least. you catch on quickly.

618
00:49:47.530 --> 00:49:49.520
That little...

619
00:50:06.060 --> 00:50:08.370
- Come on.
- Excuse me.

620
00:50:28.580 --> 00:50:30.470
Why are you taking it out on a machine?

621
00:50:30.470 --> 00:50:32.560
I'm sorry.

622
00:50:47.400 --> 00:50:49.240
Aren't we in the same class?

623
00:50:53.710 --> 00:50:55.090
Yes.

624
00:51:14.860 --> 00:51:16.710
Don't kick the machine.

625
00:51:18.440 --> 00:51:19.580
Okay.

626
00:51:58.890 --> 00:52:02.230
[Nulji Science and Technology High School]

627
00:52:28.640 --> 00:52:30.060
Well. everyone.

628
00:52:30.060 --> 00:52:33.520
What shall we make today?

629
00:52:34.880 --> 00:52:38.740
To be honest. just knowing how to use the machines is...

630
00:52:38.740 --> 00:52:39.890
You know what I mean. right?

631
00:52:41.400 --> 00:52:42.750
Yes?

632
00:52:42.750 --> 00:52:45.540
We studied using hand tools.

633
00:52:46.430 --> 00:52:48.170
- Why?
- Pardon?

634
00:52:48.170 --> 00:52:53.800
Well. Mr. Kim said we have to know the properties of the wood first...

635
00:52:53.800 --> 00:52:55.200
Oh.

636
00:52:55.200 --> 00:52:57.940
He was that kind of teacher.

637
00:52:57.940 --> 00:53:00.690
Well then. let's see.

638
00:53:00.690 --> 00:53:03.510
Making the roof of a pavilion. Aigoo.

639
00:53:03.510 --> 00:53:05.440
This will take forever.

640
00:53:05.440 --> 00:53:08.450
This isn't so easy.

641
00:53:08.450 --> 00:53:10.100
Then how about...

642
00:53:10.100 --> 00:53:13.030
Oh! Making a pencil holder.

643
00:53:13.030 --> 00:53:14.430
Let's do this.

644
00:53:15.140 --> 00:53:16.350
Excuse me.

645
00:53:16.350 --> 00:53:17.370
Yes?

646
00:53:18.300 --> 00:53:20.400
We did that in 10th grade.

647
00:53:21.490 --> 00:53:22.500
Oh.

648
00:53:23.230 --> 00:53:24.460
You did it?

649
00:53:25.880 --> 00:53:27.110
Okay. good.

650
00:53:27.110 --> 00:53:28.840
This is the basics.

651
00:53:28.840 --> 00:53:31.090
Okay. alright. Then...

652
00:53:31.090 --> 00:53:33.350
Let's see.

653
00:53:33.350 --> 00:53:35.110
But...

654
00:53:35.110 --> 00:53:37.650
why are you looking at me like that?

655
00:53:38.420 --> 00:53:40.080
You have a p-problem with me?

656
00:53:51.500 --> 00:53:53.220
<i>I messed with the wrong kid.</i>

657
00:53:53.220 --> 00:53:54.850
I don't have a problem.

658
00:53:54.850 --> 00:53:57.520
Can you give me back my lighter that you borrowed?

659
00:54:06.570 --> 00:54:09.880
You really-you do whatever you want. huh?

660
00:54:09.880 --> 00:54:12.500
Show some basic manners. at least.

661
00:54:12.500 --> 00:54:14.220
I see.

662
00:54:14.220 --> 00:54:17.390
I don't really know what basic manners are.

663
00:54:19.760 --> 00:54:21.150
This doesn't work well.

664
00:54:39.460 --> 00:54:41.870
The new teacher is interesting.

665
00:54:41.870 --> 00:54:43.010
He's weird.

666
00:54:43.010 --> 00:54:45.650
I liked Mr. Kim better.

667
00:54:45.650 --> 00:54:47.860
You sound pathetic.

668
00:54:47.860 --> 00:54:51.170
Hey. He's much better. He's more qualified.

669
00:54:51.170 --> 00:54:53.030
Oh. I see.

670
00:54:53.030 --> 00:54:54.540
Piss off.

671
00:55:02.080 --> 00:55:03.550
[Lee Kang Hoon]

672
00:55:05.340 --> 00:55:07.070
[Jin Sung University Department of Architecture. Lee Kang Hoon. awarded President's Award for excellence in carpentry]

673
00:55:11.100 --> 00:55:13.040
Gosh. seriously.

674
00:55:13.040 --> 00:55:15.150
Our class atmosphere is so intense.

675
00:55:15.150 --> 00:55:17.100
So scary.

676
00:55:17.100 --> 00:55:19.530
He doesn't seem like a bad kid.

677
00:55:19.600 --> 00:55:23.000
That's not important. Tell us what you were going to say earlier.

678
00:55:23.010 --> 00:55:25.650
Ki Joon followed you to your workplace?

679
00:55:26.410 --> 00:55:28.060
What do you mean followed?

680
00:55:28.060 --> 00:55:31.060
He was just there to work too.

681
00:55:31.060 --> 00:55:33.400
Isn't this pretty much a confession?

682
00:55:33.400 --> 00:55:35.500
- Huh?
- Well. look at it.

683
00:55:35.530 --> 00:55:37.960
He followed you to the apprenticeship. and now he's working where you are.

684
00:55:37.960 --> 00:55:41.460
There are tons of places to work. so why?

685
00:55:41.460 --> 00:55:45.280
I guess that is the only fast food restaurant around here.

686
00:55:45.280 --> 00:55:47.130
Oh. my God.

687
00:55:47.130 --> 00:55:49.310
What are you going to do if Ki Joon confesses to you?

688
00:55:49.310 --> 00:55:50.590
Are you going to accept him?

689
00:55:50.590 --> 00:55:52.430
No way.

690
00:55:52.430 --> 00:55:54.340
He and I are...

691
00:55:57.160 --> 00:55:58.380
arch-nemeses.

692
00:55:59.160 --> 00:56:01.350
Now that you mention it.

693
00:56:01.350 --> 00:56:04.540
what happened to you two in the past?

694
00:56:04.540 --> 00:56:07.210
One person says you guys dated.

695
00:56:07.210 --> 00:56:10.070
another person says you beat each other up.

696
00:56:12.720 --> 00:56:15.360
That little prick played a trick on me. and I hit him.

697
00:56:15.360 --> 00:56:17.060
<i>Hey. Kong Ki Joon!</i>

698
00:56:26.200 --> 00:56:29.000
Really? That's it?

699
00:56:37.310 --> 00:56:38.470
Yeah.

700
00:56:39.470 --> 00:56:41.070
That's all.

701
00:56:41.070 --> 00:56:44.770
All that aside. Gong Ki Joon isn't little anymore.

702
00:56:54.840 --> 00:56:56.990
[Student Records: Jung Young Joo]

703
00:56:59.130 --> 00:57:00.560
[10th and 11th grade: Engineering and Construction / 11th grade: Architectural Design]

704
00:57:00.560 --> 00:57:02.520
<i>Can you give me back my lighter that you borrowed?</i>

705
00:57:02.520 --> 00:57:04.610
<i>Show some basic manners. at least.</i>

706
00:57:05.520 --> 00:57:07.050
<i>This doesn't work well.</i>

707
00:57:29.590 --> 00:57:30.600
Mr. Lee.

708
00:57:31.510 --> 00:57:33.960
You studied architectural design at Jin Sung University. right?

709
00:57:36.650 --> 00:57:38.090
You're fast.

710
00:57:38.090 --> 00:57:39.250
Where did you hear that?

711
00:57:39.250 --> 00:57:41.370
Please establish a carpentry club.

712
00:57:41.370 --> 00:57:43.110
To prepare for this.

713
00:57:46.700 --> 00:57:49.040
[Carpentry competition hosted by Jin Sung University]
I'm going to get in here.

714
00:57:49.040 --> 00:57:52.420
I know external competitions don't count toward the student records.

715
00:57:52.420 --> 00:57:56.740
but I'll go to this university for this major. so I know I'll get bonus points during the interview.

716
00:57:56.740 --> 00:58:00.650
Why do you have to go to this university for this major?

717
00:58:01.510 --> 00:58:04.730
It's the top school I can get in the specialized skill field.

718
00:58:04.730 --> 00:58:07.790
I came to this school so I could get into this college.

719
00:58:07.790 --> 00:58:10.010
As you can see from my last year's transcript.

720
00:58:10.010 --> 00:58:12.700
I never missed the top rank in my studies.

721
00:58:12.700 --> 00:58:16.050
Volunteer work. extracurricular clubs. competitions.

722
00:58:16.050 --> 00:58:19.160
- I prepared the portfolio to fit this major-
- Alright.

723
00:58:20.100 --> 00:58:21.700
What's your name?

724
00:58:22.700 --> 00:58:24.270
Kang Seo Young.

725
00:58:24.300 --> 00:58:27.690
Okay. Seo Young. Let's talk tomorrow.

726
00:58:27.690 --> 00:58:29.300
Good work today.

727
00:58:29.300 --> 00:58:31.880
- Bye.
- See you tomorrow.

728
00:58:35.860 --> 00:58:37.730
[Carpentry competition hosted by Jin Sung University]

729
00:59:05.560 --> 00:59:07.540
<i>What are you going to do if Ki Joon confesses to you?</i>

730
00:59:07.540 --> 00:59:08.900
<i>Are you going to accept him?</i>

731
00:59:09.750 --> 00:59:13.210
<i>All that aside. Gong Ki Joon isn't little anymore.</i>

732
00:59:14.430 --> 00:59:16.570
<i>He use to be a shortie.</i>

733
00:59:21.860 --> 00:59:24.950
Isn't it a rule to spy on someone without them knowing?

734
00:59:32.510 --> 00:59:33.930
What?

735
00:59:39.920 --> 00:59:41.350
What?

736
00:59:44.360 --> 00:59:46.740
You have to fold it properly.

737
00:59:47.650 --> 00:59:49.090
Stupid.

738
00:59:51.770 --> 00:59:53.470
I was doing fine.

739
01:00:07.340 --> 01:00:08.910
I guess it's different.

740
01:00:22.490 --> 01:00:23.940
Hey...

741
01:00:23.940 --> 01:00:26.010
didn't you hurt yourself?

742
01:00:26.010 --> 01:00:27.080
What?

743
01:00:32.200 --> 01:00:33.880
It stings.

744
01:00:33.880 --> 01:00:35.000
Huh?

745
01:00:36.290 --> 01:00:37.920
So suddenly?

746
01:00:37.920 --> 01:00:39.080
Yeah...

747
01:00:46.920 --> 01:00:48.280
Aigoo.

748
01:00:50.810 --> 01:00:52.980
I don't know which of us is stupid here.

749
01:00:52.980 --> 01:00:54.910
You didn't even know you were hurt and kept working?

750
01:00:54.910 --> 01:00:57.050
This is a wound of glory.

751
01:00:57.050 --> 01:00:58.830
What would a newbie like you know?

752
01:00:58.830 --> 01:01:01.070
Wow. is that so?

753
01:01:03.010 --> 01:01:04.320
Why don't you go to a hospital?

754
01:01:04.320 --> 01:01:06.150
You'll get a scar.

755
01:01:06.150 --> 01:01:08.640
It's fine. It's nothing.

756
01:01:19.760 --> 01:01:21.280
Give it to me.

757
01:02:14.500 --> 01:02:17.100
<i>What? Does it remind you of the old days?</i>

758
01:02:25.210 --> 01:02:26.930
What are you talking about?

759
01:02:30.100 --> 01:02:31.940
You kissed me.

760
01:02:31.940 --> 01:02:33.260
Hey.

761
01:02:33.260 --> 01:02:34.870
When? Am I crazy?

762
01:02:34.870 --> 01:02:37.310
That was definitely a mistake. I bumped into you.

763
01:02:39.360 --> 01:02:41.030
Do you like me?

764
01:02:42.640 --> 01:02:44.260
Why are you overreacting?

765
01:02:46.250 --> 01:02:49.460
What are you talking about? Shortie.

766
01:02:54.350 --> 01:02:57.080
I'm not that little kid who cried after you hit me.

767
01:02:57.080 --> 01:02:58.510
Don't make me laugh.

768
01:02:58.510 --> 01:03:03.320
You're still a pathetic little shortie to me.

769
01:03:03.320 --> 01:03:05.280
- Really?
- Really.

770
01:03:18.100 --> 01:03:22.160
♫ <i>Dream on. dream on</i> ♫

771
01:03:22.190 --> 01:03:26.060
♫ <i>Dream on</i> ♫

772
01:03:26.100 --> 01:03:28.470
♫ <i>Dream on</i> ♫

773
01:03:28.470 --> 01:03:30.630
Then try it again.

774
01:03:30.700 --> 01:03:33.800
♫ <i>Dream on</i> ♫

775
01:03:33.820 --> 01:03:39.500
♫ <i>My heart keeps thinking of you</i> ♫

776
01:03:39.500 --> 01:03:43.700
♫ <i>I can't even understand myself</i> ♫

777
01:03:43.700 --> 01:03:49.310
♫ <i>I'm always curious about you</i> ♫

778
01:03:49.310 --> 01:03:51.460
♫ <i>I dream of meeting you</i> ♫

779
01:03:51.460 --> 01:03:55.230
♫ <i>Dream on. dream on</i> ♫

780
01:03:55.230 --> 01:03:57.100
♫ <i>Dream on</i> ♫

781
01:03:57.100 --> 01:03:59.730
♫ <i>I'm dreaming right now</i> ♫

782
01:03:59.730 --> 01:04:03.920
♫ <i>Dream on. dream on. dream on</i> ♫

783
01:04:04.000 --> 01:04:11.030
♫ <i>Dream on. I'll grow closer to you</i> ♫

784
01:04:11.030 --> 01:04:17.470
♫ <i>The afternoon sun shimmers on the windowsill</i> ♫

785
01:04:17.470 --> 01:04:20.430
[School 2021]

786
01:04:20.430 --> 01:04:22.450
<i>Didn't you hear what I said?</i>

787
01:04:22.450 --> 01:04:23.940
<i>I told you not to hang around me.</i>

788
01:04:23.940 --> 01:04:26.950
<i>I think Ki Joon's still doing taekwondo.</i>

789
01:04:26.950 --> 01:04:27.970
<i>You won't do it anymore?</i>

790
01:04:27.970 --> 01:04:29.020
<i>Hey. hey!</i>

791
01:04:29.020 --> 01:04:31.620
<i>Say that again. Fun?</i>

792
01:04:31.620 --> 01:04:33.900
<i>Why do you hate Gong Ki Joon?</i>

